    "text": "By Rob Nikolewski The San Diego Union-Tribune ,\n1 hours ago SAN DIEGO — The San Diego County Board of Supervisors on Tuesday adopted a resolution vowing to fight efforts by the Trump administration to expand offshore oil and gas drilling more than three miles off the coast of California. The measure, approved on a 4-1 vote, was introduced by... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
